{"video_id":"zHEb-t0Xe-w","title":"Lightning Talk: The Third Operator","conference":"sans-ai-summit","language":"en","auto_generated":true,"source":"supa","timing":"exact","word_count":499,"segments":[{"start":2.2,"duration":4.12,"text":"So,"},{"start":3.76,"duration":4.64,"text":"for most of cybersecurity, we had two"},{"start":6.32,"duration":3.36,"text":"operators in the system."},{"start":8.4,"duration":2.76,"text":"The attacker"},{"start":9.68,"duration":3.92,"text":"and the defender."},{"start":11.16,"duration":4.32,"text":"Every control we wrote, every every"},{"start":13.6,"duration":4.32,"text":"control we built, every playbook we"},{"start":15.48,"duration":5.12,"text":"wrote, every threat model we trusted,"},{"start":17.92,"duration":4.52,"text":"they all assumed that the meaningful"},{"start":20.6,"duration":3.32,"text":"decision-maker"},{"start":22.44,"duration":4.72,"text":"is human."},{"start":23.92,"duration":5.44,"text":"But that model is starting to break."},{"start":27.16,"duration":4.28,"text":"Cuz now we have a third operator,"},{"start":29.36,"duration":4.6,"text":"AI."},{"start":31.44,"duration":4.64,"text":"And we will defend against AI, we will"},{"start":33.96,"duration":6.2,"text":"defend with AI, and sometimes we will"},{"start":36.08,"duration":4.08,"text":"defend against our own AI."},{"start":42.44,"duration":2.36,"text":"So,"},{"start":44.16,"duration":2.44,"text":"um"},{"start":44.8,"duration":3.28,"text":"this"},{"start":46.6,"duration":4.04,"text":"throughout your entire career, you were"},{"start":48.08,"duration":4.2,"text":"used to threat modeling an attacker as"},{"start":50.64,"duration":4.36,"text":"human."},{"start":52.28,"duration":5.88,"text":"That model is now wrong."},{"start":55.0,"duration":6.2,"text":"Because we're already seeing AI"},{"start":58.16,"duration":4.96,"text":"exceeding human experts at a variety of"},{"start":61.2,"duration":3.56,"text":"uh security functions."},{"start":63.12,"duration":5.04,"text":"Writing vulnerability finding"},{"start":64.76,"duration":5.36,"text":"vulnerabilities, writing exploits,"},{"start":68.16,"duration":4.64,"text":"basically automating every phase of the"},{"start":70.12,"duration":2.68,"text":"attack chain."},{"start":73.92,"duration":2.68,"text":"And"},{"start":79.52,"duration":5.88,"text":"this isn't just about"},{"start":82.16,"duration":3.24,"text":"AI-assisted offense."},{"start":86.12,"duration":5.88,"text":"This is changing the economics of of"},{"start":89.68,"duration":3.84,"text":"offense. We have"},{"start":92.0,"duration":4.76,"text":"things that"},{"start":93.52,"duration":6.2,"text":"um used to take effort, uh"},{"start":96.76,"duration":4.72,"text":"skill, and resources being reduced down"},{"start":99.72,"duration":7.28,"text":"to a single prompt."},{"start":101.48,"duration":7.48,"text":"It affects scale, speed, and who is"},{"start":107.0,"duration":4.76,"text":"able to get access to those"},{"start":108.96,"duration":2.8,"text":"capabilities."},{"start":112.4,"duration":5.8,"text":"But the most interesting thing happens"},{"start":114.88,"duration":6.2,"text":"when the operator is already inside, we"},{"start":118.2,"duration":4.2,"text":"put these trusted entities, highly"},{"start":121.08,"duration":4.16,"text":"capable entities within our"},{"start":122.4,"duration":5.68,"text":"environments, we give them tools,"},{"start":125.24,"duration":4.36,"text":"permissions, business context, and"},{"start":128.08,"duration":4.6,"text":"increasingly"},{"start":129.6,"duration":3.08,"text":"also initiative."},{"start":133.64,"duration":4.64,"text":"But the scary part is that they don't"},{"start":136.68,"duration":4.48,"text":"have to be compromised in order to"},{"start":138.28,"duration":2.88,"text":"become dangerous."},{"start":141.52,"duration":3.96,"text":"We are already seeing these agents"},{"start":144.24,"duration":4.8,"text":"um"},{"start":145.48,"duration":3.56,"text":"disable security controls,"},{"start":149.08,"duration":5.32,"text":"exfiltrate data,"},{"start":151.52,"duration":4.76,"text":"discover and exploit vulnerabilities,"},{"start":154.4,"duration":3.32,"text":"escalate privileges,"},{"start":156.28,"duration":4.16,"text":"not because they were hacked, not"},{"start":157.72,"duration":6.4,"text":"because someone told them to do so,"},{"start":160.44,"duration":6.12,"text":"because they were simply"},{"start":164.12,"duration":5.0,"text":"hitting a boundary and not seeing it as"},{"start":166.56,"duration":5.6,"text":"a stop sign, but seeing it seeing it as"},{"start":169.12,"duration":5.4,"text":"a problem they need to solve."},{"start":172.16,"duration":4.72,"text":"And your current controls"},{"start":174.52,"duration":3.88,"text":"were designed to"},{"start":176.88,"duration":5.24,"text":"um"},{"start":178.4,"duration":7.44,"text":"to deal with abuse, intrusion, not this."},{"start":182.12,"duration":4.76,"text":"But that's only half the picture because"},{"start":185.84,"duration":4.6,"text":"now"},{"start":186.88,"duration":6.84,"text":"when AI is an attacker, attacker is AI,"},{"start":190.44,"duration":6.2,"text":"um it can also be a target. And once it"},{"start":193.72,"duration":4.72,"text":"does, then your environment also becomes"},{"start":196.64,"duration":5.6,"text":"part of the attack surface."},{"start":198.44,"duration":5.68,"text":"Everything the agent perceives,"},{"start":202.24,"duration":5.76,"text":"remembers,"},{"start":204.12,"duration":7.16,"text":"has access to, and eventually does,"},{"start":208.0,"duration":5.92,"text":"is affected by in the environment."},{"start":211.28,"duration":2.64,"text":"So,"},{"start":214.16,"duration":3.32,"text":"you can"},{"start":215.4,"duration":2.08,"text":"um"},{"start":219.08,"duration":3.76,"text":"And And our current security controls,"},{"start":221.24,"duration":3.16,"text":"as I as I mentioned, weren't built for"},{"start":222.84,"duration":3.28,"text":"that."},{"start":224.4,"duration":5.64,"text":"Not because we weren't smart enough,"},{"start":226.12,"duration":6.6,"text":"because they simply didn't exist."},{"start":230.04,"duration":2.68,"text":"So,"},{"start":233.56,"duration":6.44,"text":"if we assume that this operator is"},{"start":236.2,"duration":6.52,"text":"already here, what does it mean for us?"},{"start":240.0,"duration":4.56,"text":"So, it means that we will be defending"},{"start":242.72,"duration":5.32,"text":"against AI because attackers will use"},{"start":244.56,"duration":5.4,"text":"it. We will be defending with AI because"},{"start":248.04,"duration":4.32,"text":"we'll have to."},{"start":249.96,"duration":5.08,"text":"But, we will also be defending against"},{"start":252.36,"duration":7.4,"text":"our own AI because"},{"start":255.04,"duration":7.28,"text":"once we have these privileged"},{"start":259.76,"duration":5.48,"text":"autonomous capable"},{"start":262.32,"duration":6.68,"text":"entrusted systems in our environment,"},{"start":265.24,"duration":3.76,"text":"they can also become a liability."},{"start":269.2,"duration":3.32,"text":"And"},{"start":271.4,"duration":2.72,"text":"if you"},{"start":272.52,"duration":3.2,"text":"leave here with one thing, remember"},{"start":274.12,"duration":3.04,"text":"this. So,"},{"start":275.72,"duration":4.64,"text":"stop"},{"start":277.16,"duration":5.52,"text":"threat modeling AI like a tool and start"},{"start":280.36,"duration":4.28,"text":"threat modeling it"},{"start":282.68,"duration":5.84,"text":"like an operator. Because once that"},{"start":284.64,"duration":6.76,"text":"operator is again autonomous, trusted,"},{"start":288.52,"duration":5.88,"text":"capable, but also influenceable,"},{"start":291.4,"duration":3.0,"text":"everything changes."},{"start":295.41,"duration":2.02,"text":">> [applause]"}]}